<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Thryve Growth — Marketing & Growth Agency</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --cream: #F8F6F1;
    --warm-white: #FDFCFA;
    --charcoal: #1C1C1A;
    --mid: #5A5A56;
    --muted: #9B9990;
    --accent: #2B4D3E;
    --accent-light: #E8F0EC;
    --accent-mid: #4A7C65;
    --border: rgba(28,28,26,0.1);
    --border-light: rgba(28,28,26,0.06);
    --serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    --sans: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    background: var(--warm-white);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.25rem 3rem;
    background: rgba(253,252,250,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent-mid); font-style: italic; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--charcoal); }
  .nav-cta {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    background: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--accent-mid); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 0 3rem 5rem;
    background: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-bg-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(12rem, 22vw, 22rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(28,28,26,0.04);
    white-space: nowrap;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent-mid);
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-mid); }
  .hero-bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .hero-desc {
    max-width: 380px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .btn-primary {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    background: var(--charcoal);
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent); }
  .btn-secondary {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { color: var(--charcoal); }
  .hero-scroll {
    position: absolute;
    right: 3rem;
    bottom: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .scroll-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--muted);
    animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes scrollPulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); }
    50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }
  }
  .hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  .stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }

  /* SECTION COMMON */
  section { padding: 7rem 3rem; }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  .section-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-mid);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .section-tag::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent-mid);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-mid); }

  /* SERVICES */
  .services { background: var(--warm-white); }
  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .service-card {
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .service-card:hover { background: var(--accent-light); }
  .service-num {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(28,28,26,0.08);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .service-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .service-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--mid); line-height: 1.7; }
  .services-bottom {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .services-bottom p { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--charcoal); max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .services-bottom p em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent-mid); }

  /* WORK */
  .work { background: var(--cream); }
  .work-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5px; background: var(--border); }
  .work-card {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 3.5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .work-card:hover { background: var(--accent-light); }
  .work-card.large { grid-column: span 2; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
  .work-tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .work-tag::before { content: '●'; font-size: 0.5rem; }
  .work-client { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .work-result { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--mid); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .work-stats { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
  .work-stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .work-stat-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--charcoal); }
  .work-stat-label { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .work-visual {
    height: 240px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-light) 0%, rgba(74,124,101,0.15) 100%);
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .work-visual-text {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(43,77,62,0.15);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .work-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 3rem;
    right: 3rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: transform 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .work-card:hover .work-arrow { transform: translate(4px, -4px); color: var(--accent); }

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .testimonials { background: var(--charcoal); }
  .testimonials .section-tag { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .testimonials .section-tag::before { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
  .testimonials .section-title { color: var(--warm-white); }
  .testimonials .section-title em { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
  .testi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .testi-card {
    padding: 3rem;
    background: var(--charcoal);
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .testi-card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
  .testi-quote-mark {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 0.5;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .testi-quote {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .testi-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
  .testi-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .testi-name { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .testi-role { font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-top: 0.15rem; }

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact { background: var(--warm-white); }
  .contact-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .contact-left .section-title { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .contact-left p { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--mid); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .contact-detail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .contact-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }
  .contact-row-label { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); width: 80px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .contact-row-value { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--charcoal); }
  .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .form-label { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .form-input, .form-textarea, .form-select {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    width: 100%;
    appearance: none;
  }
  .form-input:focus, .form-textarea:focus, .form-select:focus { border-color: var(--accent-mid); }
  .form-textarea { min-height: 140px; resize: vertical; }
  .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .form-submit {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--warm-white);
    background: var(--charcoal);
    border: none;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .form-submit:hover { background: var(--accent); }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    background: var(--charcoal);
    padding: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .footer-logo { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .footer-logo span { font-style: italic; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
  .footer-copy { font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
  .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
  .footer-links a {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }

  /* FADE IN */
  .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease; }
  .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    section { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }
    .hero { padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem; }
    .hero-title { font-size: 3rem; }
    .hero-stats { gap: 1.5rem; }
    .hero-bottom { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .section-header { flex-direction: column; }
    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .work-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .work-card.large { grid-column: span 1; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .testi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .footer-links { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">Thryve <span>Growth</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
    <li><a href="#testimonials">Clients</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Start a Project</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-bg-text">Thryve</div>

  <div class="hero-stats fade-in">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">80+</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Brands Grown</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">$40M</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Revenue Generated</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <span class="stat-num">6</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Years of Growth</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-eyebrow fade-in">Marketing & Growth Agency</div>

  <h1 class="hero-title fade-in">
    We build brands that<br><em>command attention</em><br>and drive growth.
  </h1>

  <div class="hero-bottom fade-in">
    <p class="hero-desc">
      Strategy, branding, digital, and advertising — fully integrated growth for ambitious brands ready to scale.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#work" class="btn-primary">View Our Work</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-secondary">Get in Touch &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-scroll">
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
    <span>Scroll</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag fade-in">What We Do</span>
    <h2 class="section-title fade-in">
      Full-service growth,<br>built for <em>results</em>.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="services-grid fade-in">
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-num">01</div>
      <div class="service-name">Marketing & Strategy</div>
      <p class="service-desc">Data-driven marketing strategies that align with your goals and accelerate growth across every stage of the funnel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-num">02</div>
      <div class="service-name">Design & Branding</div>
      <p class="service-desc">Brand identities that resonate. From visual language to tone of voice — we craft brands that stand for something.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-num">03</div>
      <div class="service-name">Web & Digital</div>
      <p class="service-desc">High-converting digital experiences. Websites, landing pages, and digital assets built to perform.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-num">04</div>
      <div class="service-name">Consulting</div>
      <p class="service-desc">Strategic consulting for brands navigating growth, repositioning, or expansion into new markets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-num">05</div>
      <div class="service-name">Advertising</div>
      <p class="service-desc">Paid and organic advertising that captures attention and converts — across social, search, and beyond.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="services-bottom fade-in">
    <p>Not sure where to start? We'll help you <em>identify the gaps</em> and build the plan.</p>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Book a Strategy Call</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WORK -->
<section class="work" id="work">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag fade-in">Case Studies</span>
    <h2 class="section-title fade-in">
      Work that speaks<br>for <em>itself</em>.
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="work-grid fade-in">

    <div class="work-card large">
      <div>
        <div class="work-tag">Brand Strategy &amp; Advertising</div>
        <div class="work-client">Biome Living</div>
        <p class="work-result">Built the complete brand identity and ad strategy for a luxury modular living wall brand — from visual language to full-funnel campaigns.</p>
        <div class="work-stats">
          <div class="work-stat">
            <span class="work-stat-num">3.8&times;</span>
            <span class="work-stat-label">ROAS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="work-stat">
            <span class="work-stat-num">+220%</span>
            <span class="work-stat-label">Organic reach</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-visual">
        <span class="work-visual-text">Biome</span>
      </div>
      <span class="work-arrow">&#8599;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="work-card">
      <div class="work-tag">Marketing &amp; Social</div>
      <div class="work-client">AMPD Nutrition</div>
      <p class="work-result">Audience transfer strategy, email campaigns, and video ad scripts for a creatine + nootropics brand.</p>
      <div class="work-stats">
        <div class="work-stat">
          <span class="work-stat-num">+180%</span>
          <span class="work-stat-label">Follower growth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="work-stat">
          <span class="work-stat-num">42%</span>
          <span class="work-stat-label">Email open rate</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="work-arrow">&#8599;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="work-card">
      <div class="work-tag">Content &amp; Branding</div>
      <div class="work-client">Renshaw PT</div>
      <p class="work-result">Full brand refresh, content strategy, and custom fitness audit documents for a premium personal training brand.</p>
      <div class="work-stats">
